board approves acquiring a fintech software platform, brands and IP from related party Elanistech for a lump-sum **Rs 10 crore**, subject to member approval; the promoter holds an interest in the seller _(~10.6% of mcap)_.","**Global Health (Medanta)** - allotted a 10,560 sq. metre land parcel in Ghaziabad by UP's housing board for **Rs 165.82 crore**, earmarked for a planned 350+ bed hospital subject to board and statutory approvals _(~0.4% of mcap)_.","**Indo Borax & Chemicals** - completes its acquisition of 2,38,44,000 shares (64.26%) of Kronox Lab Sciences from three sellers, per the SPA disclosed 20 August; consideration was fixed in the original agreement.","**Coal India** - signs a non-binding MoU with Hindustan Urvarak & Rasayan to assess a coal-gasification-based urea plant at Sindri, Jharkhand; a feasibility-study stage, value not disclosed.","**Gujarat Energy** (erstwhile Gujarat Gas) - 31,27,43,617 shares of demerged unit GSPL Transmission are listed on BSE/NSE, completing the GSPC-GSPL-GEL scheme of arrangement approved earlier.","**Nuvoco Vistas** - executes definitive agreements to acquire 26% of a CleanMax SPV building a 46.4 MW wind-solar hybrid project in Rajasthan to power its cement operations; consideration not disclosed."],"capex_core":["**Monolithisch India** - approves two new Advanced Silica Complexes, at Udaipur (175,000 MTPA) and near Hospet (125,000 MTPA), combined **Rs 45 crore** capex, commercial production by mid-to-late 2027 _(~1.7% of mcap)_.","**Sai Silks (Kalamandir)** - redeploys **Rs 20.27 crore** of unutilised IPO proceeds, originally earmarked for warehouses, into setting up new stores instead, within six months, citing delays in warehouse legal diligence."],"business_updates":["**Results season** — 11 companies filed results / earnings-call material today (press releases, recordings, transcripts, presentations) — tracked in the Results tab, not itemised here.","**EMA Partners India Limited** — Press release- “EMA Partners India Limited Announces Strategic Partnership with STAIR Digital to Launch EMA STAIR Board Services"],"distress_risk":["**Sanofi India** - receives a GST show-cause notice from Gujarat's State Tax authority alleging E-Way Bill/GSTR reconciliation gaps and ineligible input credits, demand aggregating **Rs 16.40 crore**; company is preparing its response.","**Oracle Financial Services Software** - receives a penalty order of **Rs 2.93 crore** from the Income Tax Department's Faceless Penalty Centre for AY2010-11, alleging inaccurate particulars of income.","**Naturo Agrotech (ex-Naturo Indiabull)** - acknowledges a BSE show-cause notice for compulsory delisting, and says it will file its representation within 15 working days while addressing pending compliance gaps.","**TVS Srichakra** - receives a GST show-cause notice from the Deputy Commissioner of State Tax, Bhiwandi, for assessment year 2022-23; amount not stated in the filing.","**Fortis Healthcare** - the Supreme Court disposes of IHH's special leave petition challenging a Delhi High Court order for a forensic audit of IHH's 2018 acquisition of its 31% Fortis stake; IHH says it will cooperate with the audit.","**Great Eastern Shipping** - subsidiary Greatship (India) receives 8 review notices under Maharashtra VAT law from the state tax authority; amount not stated.","**BIL Vyapar** (under CIRP) - notes its 20th Committee of Creditors meeting is scheduled for 30 September.","**SKIL Infrastructure** (under CIRP) - holds its 12th Committee of Creditors meeting on 28 September; no resolution disclosed.","**Piramal Pharma** - receives a GST order confirming an input-tax-credit demand of **Rs 4.06 crore** plus an equal penalty for FY2020-23; company plans to appeal, says no material impact expected."],"open_offers":["**G-TEC JAINX EDUCATION LIMITED** — G-Tec Education Private Limited open offer for 26.0% (26.49 lakh shares) at Rs 29 vs CMP 26.97 (+7.5%); >25% acquisition (Reg 3(1)); **TENDER - offer above market**; tender window not in PA (comes with DPS/LoF); mcap Rs 27 cr"],"credit_rating_changes":["**Indian Acrylics** - Brickwork Ratings upgrades its Rs 99 crore bank facilities from **BWR D to BWR BB-/Stable** (long-term) and **BWR D to BWR A4** (short-term), after the company repaid a Rs 50 crore term loan and posted an improving quarter.","**ESDS Software Solution** - India Ratings upgrades its bank-facility rating to **IND A/Stable (long-term) / IND A1 (short-term)**."],"other_notable":["**Meenakshi India** - AGM approves a stock split of face value from Rs 10 to Rs 5 per share.","**Share India Securities** - discloses a monetary penalty levied by NSE Clearing in the ordinary course of its broking operations; says no material impact on financials.","**Deepak Nitrite** - wholly-owned subsidiary Deepak Chem Tech allots Rs 90 crore of optionally-convertible preference shares to fellow subsidiary Deepak Phenolics; an intra-group transfer, not capital raised by the company."]},"theme_titles":{"order_wins":"Order wins (notable vs mcap)","fund_raises_fresh_equity":"Fund raises (fresh equity)","equity_allotments":"Equity allotments (new)","m_and_a":"M&A / restructuring","capex_core":"Capex (core / topline)","business_updates":"Business updates","distress_risk":"Distress & risk","open_offers":"Open offers (PA)","credit_rating_changes":"Credit-rating changes","other_notable":"Other notable"},"theme_rows":{"order_wins":[{"label":"KPIGREEN","ticker":"KPIGREEN","company":"KPI Green Energy Limited","isin":"INE542W01017","pdf_link":"https://nsearchives.nseindia.com/corporate/KPIGLOBAL_29092026152717_7_KPI_Green_Reg30_NACOF_500MW_Order_29092026_Signed.pdf","mcap":7063.8},{"pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/65cf81dc-a720-4386-a73a-ce5355425b01.pdf","declared":true,"mcap":null},{"label":"BONDADA","ticker":"BONDADA","company":"Bondada Engineering Ltd","isin":"INE0Q8P01011","pdf_link":"https://www.bseindia.com/xml-data/corpfiling/AttachLive/45075f6f-fef9-410a-b